# Respond to Phrases with Themed Quotes

Whenever the user says one of the following phrases in chat, respond with a random quote from the corresponding theme:

- **'spam'**: Respond with a random Monty Python quote.
- **'may the force be with you'**: Respond with a random Star Wars quote.

This rule can be extended to support additional phrases and themes as needed.


